---
// Formulario - contact form on lime background
---
<section class="relative w-[1280px] h-[832px] mx-auto overflow-hidden bg-vecta-lime">
  <!-- Title -->
  <h2 class="absolute left-[168px] top-[148px] text-vecta-dark font-semibold text-[44px] leading-[0.959]"
      style="font-family: 'Albert Sans', sans-serif;">
    Quiero saber más
  </h2>

  <p class="absolute left-[706px] top-[151px] text-vecta-dark text-[24px]"
     style="font-family: 'Albert Sans', sans-serif;">
    Deja tu comentario aquí:
  </p>

  <!-- Comment box -->
  <div class="absolute left-[706px] top-[201px] w-[392px] h-[335px] rounded-[10px] border-2 border-vecta-dark bg-transparent"></div>

  <form class="absolute left-[175px] top-[218px] w-[451px]" style="font-family: 'Albert Sans', sans-serif;">
    <label class="block text-vecta-dark text-[20px] font-semibold mb-[6px]">Nombre:</label>
    <input type="text" class="w-full h-[47px] rounded-[10px] border-2 border-vecta-dark bg-transparent px-[14px] text-vecta-dark mb-[15px]" />

    <label class="block text-vecta-dark text-[20px] font-semibold mb-[6px]">Celular:</label>
    <input type="tel" class="w-full h-[47px] rounded-[10px] border-2 border-vecta-dark bg-transparent px-[14px] text-vecta-dark mb-[15px]" />

    <label class="block text-vecta-dark text-[20px] font-semibold mb-[6px]">Correo:</label>
    <input type="email" class="w-full h-[47px] rounded-[10px] border-2 border-vecta-dark bg-transparent px-[14px] text-vecta-dark mb-[15px]" />

    <p class="text-vecta-dark text-[20px] font-semibold mb-[8px]">Este proyecto se acomoda a ti para:</p>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-[12px] mb-[14px]">
      <span class="text-vecta-dark text-[20px]">Inversión:</span>
      <span class="inline-block w-[22px] h-[23px] rounded-[5px] border-2 border-vecta-dark"></span>
      <span class="ml-[44px] text-vecta-dark text-[20px]">Vivienda:</span>
      <span class="inline-block w-[22px] h-[23px] rounded-[5px] border-2 border-vecta-dark"></span>
    </div>

    <p class="text-vecta-dark text-[20px] font-semibold mb-[8px]">Quieres ser contactado telefónicamente:</p>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-[12px]">
      <span class="text-vecta-dark text-[20px]">Sí:</span>
      <span class="inline-block w-[22px] h-[23px] rounded-[5px] border-2 border-vecta-dark"></span>
      <span class="ml-[44px] text-vecta-dark text-[20px]">No:</span>
      <span class="inline-block w-[22px] h-[23px] rounded-[5px] border-2 border-vecta-dark"></span>
    </div>
  </form>

  <!-- Consent + checkbox -->
  <div class="absolute left-[706px] top-[549px] w-[395px] flex gap-[12px]">
    <span class="mt-[3px] inline-block w-[18px] h-[18px] rounded-[3px] border-2 border-vecta-dark shrink-0"></span>
    <p class="text-vecta-dark text-[14px] leading-[1.3]" style="font-family: 'Albert Sans', sans-serif;">
      Autorizo a recibir información del proyecto a mi correo electrónico y autorizo el uso de mis datos según la política de tratamiento de datos personales.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Submit button -->
  <button class="absolute left-[875px] top-[640px] w-[214px] h-[47px] rounded-[10px] bg-vecta-dark text-white text-[28px] font-semibold flex items-center justify-center"
          style="font-family: 'Albert Sans', sans-serif;">
    ENVIAR
  </button>
</section>
